# =============================================================================
# sift .gitignore
#
# The .sift-local/ folder is the local-only workspace for internal artifacts:
# plans, research, agent files, ADRs, spikes, doc mirrors. It is never pushed.
# =============================================================================

# --- Internal-only workspace (never pushed) ---------------------------------
# All engineering guardrails, plans, research, and agent artifacts live locally.
.sift-local/
.sift-local/**
rules/
rules/**

# --- Common agent / assistant artifacts -------------------------------------
